{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/e6ef3b60b24e3a8ec46e97168112c46f.poster.avif?t=1767309285\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/e6ef3b60b24e3a8ec46e97168112c46f.webm?t=1767309285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/e6ef3b60b24e3a8ec46e97168112c46f.mp4?t=1767309285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Math Climber</strong> is not for the faint of heart, but master it's controls and you'll be rewarded with the greatest treasure of all. The treasure of <i>LEARNING</i>.<br><br>Think you\u2019ve got the reflexes of a ninja <i>AND</i> the math skills of a calculator on overdrive?! <strong>Math Climber</strong> cranks up the chaos, throwing you into a mind-melting adventure where every jump counts and every equation could be your last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is everything. Miss a platform? Say hello to the abyss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/b24c4f3b1e0e02909ae530deb39eaf96.poster.avif?t=1767309285\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/b24c4f3b1e0e02909ae530deb39eaf96.webm?t=1767309285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/b24c4f3b1e0e02909ae530deb39eaf96.mp4?t=1767309285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >